    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d4">

                <pb facs="0043" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1977-80v16/pg6"/>

                <head>4. Memorandum From the President’s Assistant for National Security Affairs
                    (Brzezinski) to Secretary of State Vance, Director of Central Intelligence
                    Turner, and the Director of the United States Information Agency
                        (Reinhardt)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d4-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1977-06-27">June 27, 1977</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Cubans in Angola</item>
                </list>
                <p>The President recently noted a report on Cubans in Angola.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d4-f2"/> The report stated that the image of Cubans as the new
                    colonialists has spread. According to the report, the Angolans frequently
                    criticize the <pb facs="0044" n="7" xml:id="pg7"/> Cubans for being arrogant,
                    for ignoring African sensibilities, and for monopolizing with the Soviets the
                    few remaining luxuries in the country. Furthermore, the Cubans and the Soviets
                    are also being faulted for lack of economic progress and the failure to
                    eliminate insurgency.</p>
                <p>In response to this report, the President asked whether we have any propaganda
                    capability. For example, radio broadcasting? Would you please provide a report
                    to me in response to the President’s question.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d4-f3"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Zbigniew Brzezinski</hi><anchor n="4" xml:id="d4-f4"/>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
